dance Smooth
// The middle pushes the morph; the hi-hats bring it nearer; the middle sets how fast it spins and
// the bass turns it.
// Inspired by smouve, a DancerDNA music style.

morph follows music.mid speed 0.864 settle 0.01
zoom follows music.high_hit amount 0.5 settle 68.5
spin follows music.mid from 11.5 to 80.2 smooth 2.5
turn on music.bass changes by 0.49
